          "q": "What is Abacus?",
          "a": "Abacus is the first mechanical computing device, developed by the Chinese around 3000 to 4000 years ago. It is made of a wooden rack with metal rods."
        },
        {
          "q": "What is Napier's Bone?",
          "a": "Napier's Bones was a manually operated calculating device invented by John Napier. It consists of eleven rods -- ten carved with multiplication tables from 0 to 9, and one carved with the numbers 1 to 9."
        }
